  <item>
    <title>Ep.48｜ 盘点家中长期主义的好物以及家庭版ERP系统分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690979db05d56708a09073c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690979db05d56708a09073c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Nov 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>双十一已经开始啦！开始买买买啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年双十一开始之前，我问了阿杰有没有需要补货的，他突然甩给我一个表格👇</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>我真的被震惊了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个确实是我一直就希望看到的模式，可能很多事就是开头很难，但是只要开始了就会很舒适，强迫症真的大喜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这个表格的盘点下，趁着大促之际我们对家中一些日用品进行了补货，也趁机发掘了家中那些默默陪伴的长期主义的好物，以及有一些非理性的购物，这次就浅浅来分享下。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【内容提要】</span></h3><span></span><p><strong><span>⭐️长期主义好物分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> sam一次性抹布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 电压力锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 苹果键盘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 电饭煲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 森海塞尔小馒头头戴式耳机（不推荐）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 德龙胶囊咖啡机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 徕芬电动牙刷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 小米智能门锁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 乐歌升降桌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 海氏烤箱（不推荐）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> homepod一代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 松下台上洗碗机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> switch一代</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> ⭐️家庭版ERP分享</span></strong></p><span></span><h3><span>【收听方式】</span></h3><span></span><p><span>推荐使用小宇宙APP、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、苹果播客、Spotify订阅收听《🐙八爪鱼FM》。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【互动方式】</span></h3><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：夜間飛行</span></p><span></span><p><span>反馈交流/商务合作：gong0906@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
