  <item>
    <title>Ep.41 | 福州2天之旅，去看周杰伦演唱会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664ec9f14efbc0c3dc7b2310</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664ec9f14efbc0c3dc7b2310</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>童年的纸飞机终于回到我手里～</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为抢到了周杰伦嘉年华演唱会福州站的票。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlWwDTQrZkKVSR4vs2AxCWdKNk01.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>所以有了这次周末福州之旅，和大家一起唠唠嗑，分享下吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>很喜欢旅途中那些不期而遇的惊喜，带着期待的往往容易扑空。</span></p><span></span><p><span>和喜欢的人一起去看演唱会真的美妙呀！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZ9UXkgeZRVIEgqo_2TMu3OazmL.jpg"></figure><span></span><h3><span>【内容提要】</span></h3><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 周杰伦和大家打招呼啦🙋&amp;阿杰跟唱侠的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 什么时候开始听的周杰伦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 演唱会前的city walk：吃荔枝肉、公园下象棋、等一杯90分钟的唐沫茶兮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">23:13</a> 要去见周杰伦了！</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【收听方式】</span></h3><span></span><p><span>推荐使用小宇宙APP、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、苹果播客、Spotify订阅收听《🐙八爪鱼FM》。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【互动方式】</span></h3><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：夜間飛行</span></p><span></span><p><span>反馈交流/商务合作：gong0906@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
