  <item>
    <title>Ep.38 | 日本旅行（上）：来抄J人的作业，轻松玩日本</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a0bc931519ccb103f236eb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a0bc931519ccb103f236eb</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jan 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>2023.12.28-2024.1.8，日本跨年之旅结束啦！</span></h2><span></span><p><span>趁热打铁和大家分享下我们这次的准备和大致游玩感受，希望给大家有一些参考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下一期，我们会分享对日本的一些个人感受和小洞察。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【内容提要】</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>⭕️准备篇</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>办签证</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>做攻略</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>迷失在日本的公共交通里，计算是否需要JR Pass</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>订机票</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>确定出发时间后订机票，以及国内机票</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>订酒店</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>购汇换现金</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>换多少现金合适？</span></p><span></span><p><span>全币种卡和美元信用卡的区别</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>流量卡</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>流量卡的套餐选择和租赁wifi的对比</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>行李准备</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>南方的孩子没有御寒衣物，又怕未知的冷</span></p><span></span><p><span>采购物资：雪地靴、冲锋裤、帽子手套围巾、保暖衣、羽绒服</span></p><span></span><h2><span>⭕️抵达第一站：京都</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>美食分享</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>首站711、锦市场小吃、随缘小店、拉面（一人必点一份）、麦当劳早餐、牛丼、神户和牛、</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>日本酒店初体验</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>房间设施：空间比较大，进门左手边卫生间，中间电视和电视柜、两张椅子+小圆桌，最右边两张单人床。</span></p><span></span><p><span>地理位置：京都站6~7分钟步行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>洗漱用品：齐全，酒店的牙刷牙膏、梳子棉签等等需要在一楼前台自取。</span></p><span></span><p><span>卫生服务：简单干净。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>玩</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>八坂神社city walk、下鸭神社</span></p><span></span><h3><span>⭕️抵达第二站：东京</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>美食分享</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>居酒屋、天妇罗、鳗鱼饭、拉面、萨莉亚/MUJI、鸟贵族、一人食烤肉</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>玩</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>镰仓、富士山、银座逛uniqlo MUJI</span></p><span></span><h2><span>⭕️抵达第三站：北海道</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>零下8度怎么穿</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>阿杰：保暖衣保暖裤，卫衣、羽绒服。开始进入0下的环境。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>美食分享</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>蛋包饭、酱油拉面、咖喱面包、汤咖喱、牛乃家烤肉、冰淇淋、罗森布丁、雪蟹（刺身+水煮）、回转寿司</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>玩耍</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>大通公园city walk、旭川动物园富良野一日游、shopping</span></p><span></span><h2><span>⭕️总结&amp;其他感受</span></h2><span></span><p><span>人均审美水平非常高，颜色搭配最厉害的国家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>极简主义践行到底。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下雨天的雨伞只有黑色和透明，这该死的默契。</span></p><span></span><p><span>地铁上的口罩也是一个搭配单品，我从国内带了最普通的蓝色医用口罩一度不敢带。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【收听方式】</span></h3><span></span><p><span>推荐使用小宇宙APP、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、苹果播客、Spotify订阅收听《🐙八爪鱼FM》。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>【互动方式】</span></h3><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：夜間飛行</span></p><span></span><p><span>反馈交流/商务合作：gong0906@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkYHJjRSq2KAv-UUYUNyr6N65F9R.m4a" length="62493470" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZndFZIM0ZMdmN2a2FQbm9hTkVqVlZnbVEwVDMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
